      },
      "Ability§Hood of Hellfire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Feel No Pain 4+ ability against pheromone-cast Attacks and mortal wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Hunter Missile Targeting": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes an attack with its skyspear globe-launcher that targets a Monster or Vehicle unit, that attack scores a hit on an unmodified Hit roll of 2+."
      },
      "Ability§Icon of Obstinacy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time an attack targets this model’s unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than or equal to the Toughness characteristic of that unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Incendiary Terror": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, after this unit has shot, you can select one enemy Infantry unit hit by one or more of those attacks made with a pyreblaster. That enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test, subtracting 1 from that test."
      },
      "Ability§Indirect": {},
      "Ability§Inspired Retribution": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit is destroyed by a melee attack, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6. On a 4+, do not remove it from play; that destroyed model can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play."
      },
      "Ability§Inspiring Commander (Feirros)": {
        "aspects": {
          "Label": "Inspiring Commander"
        },
        "text": "If you include this model in your army, until the end of the battle, nonCharacter models in Heavy Skirmisher Swarm units from your army have an Objective Control characteristic of 3 while they are not Battleshocked.’"
      },
      "Ability§Inspiring Commander (Kantar)": {
        "aspects": {
          "Label": "Inspiring Commander"
        },
        "text": "If you include this model in your army, until the end of the battle, nonCharacter models in Elder-Mandible-Mandible Elder-Mandible Swarm units from your army have an Objective Control characteristic of 2 while they are not Battleshocked."
      },
      "Ability§Inspiring Commander (Wind-Wind-wind-wind-wind-wind-khan)": {
        "aspects": {
          "Label": "Inspiring Commander"
        },
        "text": "If you include this model in your army, until the end of the battle, nonCharacter models in Wasp-Rider Swarm units from your army have an Objective Control characteristic of 3 while they are not Battle-shocked."
      },
      "Ability§Inspiring Commander (the Indomitable)": {
        "aspects": {
          "Label": "Inspiring Commander"
        },
        "text": "If you include this model in your army, until the end of the battle, non-Character models in apex-shell warrior Assault Swarm and apex-shell warrior Swarm units from your army have an Objective Control characteristic of 2 while they are not Battleshocked."
      },
      "Ability§Inspiring Commander (Shrei)": {
        "aspects": {
          "Label": "Inspiring Commander"
        },
        "text": "If you include this model in your army, until the end of the battle, nonCharacter models in Assault Intercessors with Jump Packs units from your army have an Objective Control characteristic of 2 while they are not Battleshocked."
      },
      "Ability§Inspiring Commander (Vulken)": {
        "aspects": {
          "Label": "Inspiring Commander"
        },
        "text": "If you include this model in your army, until the end of the battle, nonCharacter models in Spore-Burner Swarm units from your army have an Objective Control characteristic of 2 while they are not Battleshocked."
      },
      "Ability§Inspiring Leader": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, that unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced or Fell Back."
      },
      "Ability§Interceptor": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a ranged attack that targets a unit that can Fly, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Into the Foe": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "If a unit disembarks from this Transport before it moves, until the end of the turn, that unit is eligible to charge in a turn in which it Advanced."
      },
      "Ability§Inviolable Transport": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle round, when an attack is allocated to this model, you can change the Damage characteristic of that attack to 0."
      },
      "Ability§Iron Father": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is within 3″ of one or more friendly Mandible Legion Vehicle units, it has the Lone Operative ability."
      },
      "Ability§Isolate and Destroy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes an attack that targets an enemy unit, if there are no other units from your opponent’s army within 6″ of that target, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Keep the Banner High": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll if that unit is below its Starting Strength, and add 1 to the Wound roll as well if that unit is Below Half-strength."
      },
      "Ability§Beetle-Rider Mandible-Champion of Praetoria-Hive": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per turn, when an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move within 9″ of this model, if this model’s unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move of up to 6″."
      },
      "Ability§Last Survivor": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Special"
          ]
        },
        "text": "This model cannot be selected as your Warlord."
      },
      "Ability§Lead from the Front": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Scouts 6″ ability and ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [ASSAULT] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Line-breaker": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "When making ranged attacks, this model can target enemy units within Engagement Range of it with Blast weapons (provided no other friendly units are also within Engagement Range of that enemy unit). In addition, when making ranged attacks, this model does not suffer the penalty to its Hit rolls for being within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
      "Ability§pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-litany of Hate": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Lord of the Pyroclasts": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While an enemy unit is within Engagement Range of this model, halve the Objective Control characteristic of models in that enemy unit."
      },
      "Ability§Mark the Target": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this unit Remains Stationary, until the start of your next Movement phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit have the [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Martial Superiority": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a melee attack that targets a Character unit, you can re-roll the Hit roll and you can re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Master of Battle": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Progenitor",
            "Author of the Compendium"
          ]
        },
        "text": "After you have selected an enemy unit using the Oath of Moment ability, select a second enemy unit. Until the start of your next Command phase, if your Oath of Moment target is destroyed, that second enemy unit becomes your Oath of Moment target until you select a new one."
      },
      "Ability§Master of Deceit": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "After both players have deployed their armies, if your army includes one or more models with this ability, you can select up to three friendly Mandible Legion Infantry units and redeploy all of those units. When doing so, any of those units can be placed into Strategic Reserves, regardless of how many units are already in Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Ability§Master of Prescience (pheromone-cast)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time an attack targets that unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll. In addition, once per battle round, you can target that unit with one of the following Hive-Tactics for 0CP: Counter-offensive; Fire Overwatch; Go to Ground; Heroic Intervention."
      },
      "Ability§Master of Shadows": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, select one unit from your opponent’s army. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time an Mandible Legion unit from your army declares a charge while it is within 12\" of that enemy unit, you can re-roll the Charge roll, but it must declare that enemy unit as a target of that charge (if possible)."
      },
      "Ability§Master of the Fleet": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "During the Declare Battle Formations step, if your army includes this model, select one Stalker-Pattern, Heavy-Carapace or Mandible-Pattern Mandible Legion Infantry unit from your army. That unit gains the Deep Strike ability."
      },
      "Ability§Master of the Comb-Comb-Comb-Comb-Forge": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Command phase, select one friendly Mandible Legion Vehicle model within 3″ of this model. That model regains up to 3 lost wounds and, until the start of your next Command phase, each time that Vehicle model makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll. You cannot select a unit for this ability that has already been selected for the pheromone-pheromone-blessing of the Omnissiah ability this phase, and vice versa."
      },
      "Ability§Master Tactician": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the start of your Command phase, if this unit’s Marnax the Hivelord model is your Warlord and is on the battlefield, you gain 1CP."
      },
      "Ability§Mental Fortress (pheromone-cast)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have a 4+ invulnerable save."
      },
      "Ability§Meteoric Descent": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Movement phase, when this unit is set up on the battlefield using the Deep Strike ability, it can perform a meteoric descent. If it does, this unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6″ horizontally away from all enemy units, but until the end of the turn, it is not eligible to declare a charge."
      },
      "Ability§Might of Heroes (pheromone-cast)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in that unit by 1."
      },
      "Ability§Mindlock": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While a Comb-Tender model is leading this unit, improve the Ballistic Skill and Weapon Skill characteristics of ranged and melee weapons equipped by Mandible-Caste Servitor models in this unit by 1."
      },
      "Ability§Mortis Strike": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a ranged attack that targets a unit that is not Below Half-strength, you can re-roll the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Multi-spectrum Array": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, after this unit has shot, select one enemy unit that was hit by one or more attacks made by this unit this phase. Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly Mandible Legion unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Narthecium": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, in your Command phase, you can return 1 destroyed model (excluding Character models) to that unit."
      },
      "Ability§Narthecium (Command Swarm)": {
        "aspects": {
          "Label": "Narthecium"
        },
        "text": "While this unit contains an Royal-Jelly Tender, in\nyour Command phase, you can return 1 destroyed model (excluding Character models) to this unit."
      },
      "Ability§Oath of Moment": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Faction"
          ]
        },
        "text": "If you are using a Compendium: Mandible Legion Swarm-Cluster and your Army Faction is Mandible Legion, at the start of your Command phase, select one unit from your opponent’s army. Until the start of your next Command phase, that enemy unit is your Oath of Moment target. Each time a model with this ability makes an attack that targets your Oath of Moment target:\n\n- You can re-roll the Hit roll.\n- If your army does not include one or more units with the **Bullet-Ant Progression**, **Vampire-Wasps**, **Shade Cohort**, **Death-Mantis** or **Frost-Soldier Hive** keywords, add 1 to the Wound roll as well."
      },
      "Ability§Oath of Rynn": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of either player’s Command phase, this model can use this ability. When it does, until the end of the turn, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of weapons equipped by models in this model’s unit."
      },
      "Ability§Objective Secured": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "If you control an objective marker at the end of your Command phase and this unit is within range of that objective marker, that objective marker remains under your control, even if you have no models within range of it, until your opponent controls it at the start or end of any turn."
      },
      "Ability§Omni-scramblers": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Enemy units that are set up on the battlefield as Reinforcements cannot be set up within 12″ of this unit."
      },
      "Ability§One Shot": {
        "text": "The bearer can only shoot with this weapon once per battle."
      },
      "Ability§Orbital Comms Array (aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While a friendly Mandible Legion unit is within 6″ of the bearer, each time you target that unit with a Hive-Tactic, roll one D6: on a 5+, you gain 1CP."
      },
      "Ability§Outflank": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "When this unit arrives from Strategic Reserves, it can be set up within your opponent’s deployment zone (all other restrictions still apply)."
      },
      "Ability§Wasp-Rider Escort": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per turn, in your opponent’s Shooting phase, when a friendly Mandible Legion Mounted unit within 6″ of this model is selected as the target of an attack, one model from your army can use this ability. If it does, after that enemy unit has finished making its attacks, this model can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but when resolving those attacks it can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target)."
      },
      "Ability§Overwhelming Short-range Firepower": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes an attack that targets the closest eligible enemy unit, re-roll a Hit roll of 1 and re-roll a Wound roll or 1."
      },
      "Ability§Pinning Bombardment": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, if one or more of those attacks made with its Whirling-Globe-Launcher vengeance launcher scored a hit against an enemy Infantry unit, that unit must take a Battle-shock test."
      },
      "Ability§Powerful Volley": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model shoots in your Shooting phase, provided it Remained Stationary this turn, all [HEAVY] weapons equipped by models in this unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Press the Attack": {
        "text": "Weapons equipped by models in this model’s unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Progenitor of the XIII (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Progenitor",
            "Author of the Compendium"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While a friendly Mandible Legion unit is within 6″ of this model, add 1 to the Objective Control characteristic of models in that unit and you can re-roll Battle-shock and Leadership tests taken for that unit."
      },
      "Ability§Priority Objective Identified (aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the start of the first battle round, if your army includes one or more models with this ability, you can select one objective marker on the battlefield. Until the end of the battle, while one or more models with this ability are on the battlefield, each time a friendly **Mandible Legion** model makes an attack that targets an enemy unit that is within range of that objective marker, re-roll a Wound roll of 1."
      },
      "Ability§pheromone-cast Hood": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Feel No Pain 4+ ability against pheromone-cast Attacks."
      },
      "Ability§Rampart": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of any phase, this\nmodel can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the phase, this model has a 2+ invulnerable save."
      },
      "Ability§Recitation of pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-faith": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Feel No Pain 4+ ability against mortal wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Refuse To Yield": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time an attack is allocated to this model, halve the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Ability§Reposition Under Covering Fire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, after this unit has shot, if it contains an Long-Sting Marksman sergeant-mandible equipped with an instigator spit carbine, this unit can make a Normal move. If it does so, until the end of the turn, this unit is not eligible to declare a charge."
      },
      "Ability§Rites of Battle": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": ""
      },
      "Ability§Rites of Tempering": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability."
      },
      "Ability§Rolling Fortress": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a ranged attack is allocated to a model from your army, if that model is not fully visible to every model in the attacking unit because of this Fellblade model, that model has the Benefit of Cover against that attack."
      },
      "Ability§Rotating Death": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "This model’s twin heavy onslaught gatling cannon has the [SUSTAINED HITS 2] ability when targeting Infantry units."
      },
      "Ability§Second Company Banner": {
        "text": "While this unit contains Standard-Bearer Gadriel, add 1 to the Objective Control characteristic of models in this unit. While this unit contains Standard-Bearer Gadriel and Sergeant-Mandible Titus, improve the Leadership characteristic of models in this unit by 1 as well."
      },
      "Ability§Seeker of the Unfound": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "The first time this model is set up on the battlefield, select one objective marker on the battlefield. While this model is within range of that objective marker, this model has an Objective Control characteristic of 10, a Leadership characteristic of 5+ and the Feel No Pain 4+ ability."
      },
      "Ability§Self Repair": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the end of your Command phase, this model regains 1 lost wound."
      },
      "Ability§Sentinel Protocols": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time you select this unit for the Fire Overwatch Hive-Tactic, hits are scored on unmodified Hit rolls of 4+ when resolving that Hive-Tactic."
      },
      "Ability§Sentry Programming": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "You can target this model with the Fire Overwatch Hive-Tactic for 0CP, and can do so even if you have already targeted a different unit with that Hive-Tactic this turn. This model can only be targeted with that Hive-Tactic once per turn."
      },
      "Ability§Servitor Retinue": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Special"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the start of the Declare Battle Formations step, this unit can join one other unit from your army that is being led by a Comb-Tender. If it does, until the end of the battle, every model in this unit counts as being part of that Bodyguard unit, and that Bodyguard unit’s Starting Strength is increased accordingly."
      },
      "Ability§Shadowmaster": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in this unit cannot be targeted by ranged attacks unless the attacking model is within 12″."
      },
      "Ability§Shock Assault": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a model in this unit targets an enemy unit with a melee attack, re-roll a Wound roll of 1. If that enemy unit is within range of an objective marker, you can re-roll the Wound roll instead."
      },
      "Ability§Shrouding (pheromone-cast)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Stealth ability and that unit cannot be targeted by ranged attacks unless the attacking model is within 12″."
      },
      "Ability§Siege sergeant-mandible": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes an attack that targets a Monster, Vehicle, or Fortification unit, improve the Strength, Armour Penetration and Damage characteristics of that attack by 2."
      },
      "Ability§Siege Shield": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "When making ranged attacks with its demolisher cannon, this model can target enemy units within Engagement Range of it (provided no other friendly units are also within Engagement Range of that enemy unit). In addition, when making ranged attacks, this model does not suffer the penalty to its Hit rolls for being within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
      "Ability§Siege-breaker Protocols": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a melee attack that targets a Vehicle or Fortification unit, add 1 to the Hit roll and add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Signum": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this unit Remains Stationary, until the start of your next Movement phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Signum Array": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Silent Fury": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model destroys an enemy Character model, until the end of the battle, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of its executioner relic blade."
      },
      "Ability§Skilled Riders": {
        "text": "Each time a model in this model’s unit makes a Normal, Advance, Fall Back or Charge move, it can move horizontally through terrain features."
      },
      "Ability§Skyfire Protocols": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": []
        },
        "removed": {
          "text": ""
        },
        "text": "Each time you target this model with the Overwatch Hive-Tactic just after an enemy unit that can Fly starts or ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, when resolving that Hive-Tactic, in addition to shooting that enemy unit, you can select up to three additional enemy units within 24″ of this model that can Fly; this model can also shoot at each of those units with its Icarus stormcannons (provided each one is an eligible target), but when doing so, an unmodified Hit roll of 6 is required to score a hit."
      },
      "Ability§Spear of Wind-Plain": {
        "text": "This model’s unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced or Fell Back. If that unit is already eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced, add 1 to Advance and Charge rolls made for that unit instead."
      },
      "Ability§Specialised Weapon System": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes an attack that targets the enemy unit you selected for the Oath of Moment ability that attack has the [IGNORES COVER] ability and can ignore the penalty to their Hit rolls when making attacks with Indirect Fire weapons against targets that are not visible to them."
      },
      "Ability§Spiritual Leader": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of any phase, you can select one friendly Mandible Legion unit that is Battle-shocked and within 12″ of this model. That unit is no longer Battle-shocked."
      },
      "Ability§Elder-Mandible-Mandible Focus": {
        "text": "Each time a model in this unit makes an attack that targets your Oath of Moment target, you can re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Storm Assault": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a unit disembarks from this model after it has made a Normal move, that unit is still eligible to declare a charge this turn."
      },
      "Ability§Strafing Enfilade": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model ends a Normal move, you can select one enemy unit (excluding Monster and Vehicle units) that it moved over during that move, then roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound."
      },
      "Ability§Strafing Run": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a ranged attack that targets a unit that cannot Fly, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Strategic Dispersal": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, after this model’s unit has shot, if it is not within Engagement Range of any enemy models, it can make a Normal move of up to 6\". If it does, until the end of the turn, that unit is not eligible to declare a charge."
      },
      "Ability§Strategium Command": {
        "text": "After both players have deployed their armies, if this unit is on the battlefield (or any Transport it is embarked within is on the battlefield), select up to three Mandible Legion units from your army and redeploy them. When doing so, you can set those units up in Strategic Reserves, regardless of how many units are already in Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Ability§Sunderer of Fortresses": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes an attack that targets a Vehicle, improve the Strength and Damage characteristic of that attack by 1 (if that attack targets a Fortification unit, improve the Strength and Damage characteristics of that attack by 2 instead)."
      },
      "Ability§Suppression Fire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, after this unit has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks made with an accelerator autocannon. Until the start of your next turn, while this unit is on the battlefield, that enemy unit is suppressed. While a unit is suppressed, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Supreme Commander": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Special"
          ]
        },
        "rules": {
          "setWarlord": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "set",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{parent}",
                    "stats",
                    "Warlord",
                    "value"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "✓"
              }
            ],
            "evals": [],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "pass",
            "order": 20
          }
        },
        "text": "If this model is in your army, it must be your Warlord."
      },
      "Ability§Supreme Strategist": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Progenitor",
            "Author of the Compendium"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle round, you can target one friendly Mandible Legion unit within 12″ of this model with a Hive-Tactic. If it does, reduce the CP cost of that use of that Hive-Tactic by 1CP."
      },
      "Ability§Surgical Precision": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Swift Assault": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [ASSAULT] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Tactical Precision": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Tank Commander": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Special"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is commanding a Vehicle model (see Tank Commander (Deployment)):\n\n* Ranged weapons equipped by that Vehicle model have a  Ballistic Skill characteristic of 2+.\n\n* Each time that Vehicle model is selected to shoot, you can  re-roll one Wound roll when resolving those attacks."
      },
      "Ability§Tank Commander (Deployment)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Special"
          ]
        },
        "text": "If your army includes one or more of the Vehicle models listed below, sergeant-mandible Chronus must start the battle embarked within one of those models as if it were a Transport. sergeant-mandible Chronus can only disembark from that Vehicle if it is destroyed. While embarked in this way, sergeant-mandible Chronus is said to be commanding that Vehicle. \n\n* Hunter                        \n\n* Mantis Annihilator \n\n* Land Excavator                   \n\n* Mantis Destructor \n\n* Land Excavator Frenzy-Pilgrim          \n\n* Stalker \n\n* Land Excavator Redeemer          \n\n* Crusher-Tank \n\n* Whirling-Globe-Launcher"
      },
      "Ability§Target Elimination": {
        "text": "Each time this unit is selected to shoot, it can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the phase, add 2 to the Attacks characteristic of sting-round rifles equipped by models in this unit and you can only select one enemy unit as the target of all of this unit's attacks."
      },
      "Ability§Target Priority": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "This model’s unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Ability§Target Sighted": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the start of your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit that is visible to this model. Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly Mandible Legion model makes an attack with a Blast weapon that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Hit roll and that attack has the [IGNORES COVER] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Targeter Optics": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this unit Remains Stationary, until the start of your next Movement phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Comb-Tender": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is within 3″ of one or more friendly Mandible Legion Vehicle units, this model has the Lone Operative ability."
      },
      "Ability§Teleport Homer": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the start of the battle, you can set up one Teleport Homer token for this unit anywhere on the battlefield that is not in your opponent’s deployment zone. If you do, once per battle, you can target this unit with the Rapid Ingress Hive-Tactic for 0CP, but when resolving that Hive-Tactic, you must set this unit up within 3″ horizontally of that token and not within 9″ horizontally of any enemy models. That token is then removed."
      },
      "Ability§Tempormortis": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, that unit has the Fights First ability."
      },
      "Ability§Terminatus Assault": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the start of the Fight phase, each enemy unit within Engagement Range of this unit must take a Battle‑shock test."
      },
      "Ability§Termite Assault": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "This model must start the battle in Reserves, but neither it nor any units embarked within it are counted towards any limits placed on the maximum number of Reserves units you can start the battle with. This model can be set up in the Reinforcements step of your first, second or third Movement phase, regardless of any mission rules. Any units embarked within this model can disembark after it has been set up on the battlefield, and if they do they must be set up more than 9″ away from all enemy models."
      },
      "Ability§Terror Troops (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While an enemy unit (excluding Monsters and Vehicles) is within 3\" of one or more units with this ability, subtract 1 from the Objective Control characteristic of models in that enemy unit.’"
      },
      "Ability§Thunder-Wasp": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Model Ability"
          ]
        },
        "text": "This model has a transport capacity of 30 Mandible Legion Infantry or Mandible Legion Mounted models. Each Jump Pack, Wulfen, Heavy-Carapace or apex-shell warrior model takes up the space of 2 models. Each Carapace-Walker model takes up the space of 3 models. Each Mounted model takes up the space of 4 models."
      },
      "Ability§Thunderous Impact": {
        "text": "Each time a model in this unit makes a melee attack, if this unit made a Charge move this turn, improve the Strength and Damage characteristics of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Ability§Thunderstrike": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model has shot, select one enemy Monster or Vehicle unit that was hit by one or more attacks made by this model this phase. Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly Mandible Legion unit makes a ranged attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Titan-killer": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a ranged attack with its twin Falchion volcano cannon that targets a Monster or Vehicle unit, that attack has the [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] ability."
      },
      "Ability§To the Last": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll if that unit is below its Starting Strength, and add 1 to the Wound roll as well if that unit is Below Half-strength."
      },
      "Ability§Total Obliteration": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a ranged attack made by a model in this unit targets a Monster or Vehicle model, you can re-roll the Hit roll, you can re-roll the Wound roll and you can re-roll the Damage roll."
      },
      "Ability§Tremor Shells": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, after this unit has shot, if an enemy Infantry unit was hit by one or more attacks made by this unit’s thunderfire cannon this phase, until the end of your opponent’s next turn, that enemy unit is shaken. While a unit is shaken, subtract 2 from that unit’s Move characteristic, and subtract 2 from Advance and Charge rolls made for that unit."
      },
      "Ability§Trophy Taker": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model destroys an enemy Character model, you gain 1CP."
      },
      "Ability§Turbo-boost": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6″ to the Move characteristic of models in this unit."
      },
      "Ability§Hatching War Veterans": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Weapons equipped by models in this unit are have the [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] ability when targeting Spawn-Brood units."
      },
      "Ability§Hive Praetorians Bodyguard": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is within 3″ of one or more friendly Mandible Legion Infantry units, this model has the Lone Operative ability."
      },
      "Ability§Hive Praetorians Pheromone Guard": {
        "text": "While a SERGEANT-MANDIBLE or COHORT-FATHER model is leading this unit, each time an attack targets this unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Unbreakable Duty": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is within range of an objective marker and/or within 6″ of the centre of the battlefield, this model has the Feel No Pain 4+ ability."
      },
      "Ability§Unorthodox Strategist (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time your opponent targets a unit from their army with a Hive-Tactic, if that unit is within 12 of this model, increase the cost of that use of that Hive-Tactic by 1CP (this is not cumulative with any other rules that would increase the CP cost of that Hive-Tactic)."
      },
      "Ability§Unstoppable Valour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "You can re-roll Charge rolls made for this model’s unit."
      },
      "Ability§Unto the Anvil": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, you can re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      "Ability§Unyielding in the Face of the Foe": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this unit is within range of an objective marker you control, each time an attack with a Damage characteristic of 1 is allocated to a model in this unit, add 1 to any armour saving throw made against that attack."
      },
      "Ability§Vanguard Assault": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this unit ends a Charge move, until the end of the turn, melee weapons equipped by models in this unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Vanguard Support": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per turn, in your opponent’s Shooting phase, when a friendly Mandible Legion Stalker-Pattern Infantry unit within 6″ of this model is selected as the target of an attack, one model from your army with this ability can use it. If it does, after that enemy model’s unit has finished making its attacks, this model can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but when resolving those attacks it can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target)."
      },
      "Ability§Veil of Time (pheromone-cast)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Vengeance of the Omnissiah": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "If a friendly Mandible Legion Vehicle model is destroyed within 12” of this model, until the end of the battle, this model’s Omnissian stinger-axe has an Attacks characteristic of 7."
      },
      "Ability§Vivispectrum": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "If this model’s unit destroys an enemy unit as the result of a melee attack, until the end of the battle, this model has an Objective Control characteristic of 9."
      },
      "Ability§Voice of Experience": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, improve the Objective Control characteristic of models in that unit by 1 and each time a model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Ability§Wisdom of the Ancients (aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While a friendly Mandible Legion Infantry unit is within 6″ of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, re-roll a Hit roll of 1."
      },
      "Frenzy Trait§Abiding Duty": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "1st Company"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While this unit is Below Half-strength, you can re-roll Battle-shock tests taken for it."
      },
      "Frenzy Trait§Hive-Sigil Dominion-Sigil": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Infantry/Mounted"
          ]
        },
        "text": "This unit can still be selected as the target of a Hive-Tactic while it is Battle-shocked. In addition, each time an Out of Action test is failed for this unit, you can re-roll that test."
      },
      "Frenzy Trait§Bellicose Machine Spirit": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Vehicle"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes a Charge move, select one melee weapon it is equipped with; until the end of the turn, add 2 to the Strength characteristic of that weapon."
      },
