                    "tally",
                    "Honourary apex-shell warrior"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "error"
          }
        },
        "text": "Select one model in this unit if this unit contains a unit mandible-champion, such as a Mandible-Soldier sergeant-mandible-, you must select that model). Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the selected model’s melee weapons and, unless the selected model is a **Character**, add 1 to its Wounds characteristic."
      },
