      "Character§Standard-Bearer": {
        "assets": {
          "traits": [
            {
              "item": "Ability§Leader",
              "text": "This model can be attached to the following units:\n\n* Charging Skirmisher Swarm\n* Desolation Swarm\n* Heavy-Mandible Swarm\n* Acid-Trooper Swarm\n\n* Spore-Burner Swarm\n\n* Skirmisher Swarm\n\n* Elder-Mandible-Mandible Elder-Mandible Swarm\n\n* Tactical Swarm\n\nYou can attach this model to one of the above units even if one Sergeant-Mandible, Cohort-Father or Junior-Mandible model has already been attached to it. If you do, and that Bodyguard unit is destroyed, the Leader units attached to it become separate units, with their original Starting Strengths."
            },
            "Ability§Oath of Moment",
            "Ability§Mandible-Caste Banner",
            "Ability§Unbreakable Duty",
            "Ranged Weapon§Newhatched Standard-Bearer—spit pistol"
          ]
        },
        "keywords": {
