      "Character§Junior-Mandible": {
        "assets": {
          "traits": [
            {
              "item": "Ability§Leader",
              "text": "This model can be attached to the following units:\n\n* Charging Skirmisher Swarm\n\n* Mandible-Guard Elder-Mandible Swarm\n\n* Company Heroes\n\n* Acid-Trooper Swarm\n\n* Spore-Burner Swarm\n\n* Skirmisher Swarm\n\n* Elder-Mandible-Mandible Elder-Mandible Swarm\n\n* Tactical Swarm\n\nYou can attach this model to a unit it can lead even if one Sergeant-Mandible or Cohort-Father model has already been attached to it. If you do, and that Bodyguard unit is destroyed, the Leader units attached to it become separate units, with their original Starting Strengths."
            },
            "Ability§Oath of Moment",
            "Ability§Tactical Precision",
            "Ability§Target Priority"
          ]
        },
