                    "tally",
                    "Vortex Sting-Round"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "error"
          }
        },
        "text": "Select one ranged weapon equipped by the bearer: that weapon is now a Progression Relic. Note this on the bearer’s Progression Card and give that weapon a suitable name. Once per battle, when the bearer shoots with that weapon, you can choose for it to fire a vortex sting-round instead of shooting that weapon normally. If it does, resolve that shooting using the following profile."
      },
