        "text": "## WRATH OF THE MOUND-BUILDER\n\nEach time a model from your army with\nthe Oath of Moment ability makes an\nattack that targets your Oath of Moment\ntarget, you can re‑roll a Wound roll of 1.\nEach time a model in a Darnath the Indomitable\nunit from your army makes an attack that\ntargets your Oath of Moment target, you\ncan re‑roll the Wound roll.\n\n## RESTRICTIONS\nYour army can include formica\nFists units, but it cannot include any\nMandible Legion units drawn from any\nother Cohort."
      },
