        "text": "# VULKEN’S QUEST\n\n\nRanged weapons equipped by Caste-of\nMandible-Caste models from your army have\nthe [ASSAULT] ability, and each time an\nattack made with such a weapon targets\na unit within 12\", add 1 to the Strength\ncharacteristic of that attack.\n\n## SEEKER’S COMPANIONS\n\nIf your army includes Vulken He’stan,\nduring your turn, each Spore-Burner Swarm\nunit from your army is eligible to do one\nof the following:\n\n■ Start to perform an Action in a turn in\nwhich it Advanced.\n\n■ Shoot in a turn in which it started to\nperform an Action."
      },
