        "text": "## OATH OF RECLAMATION\n\n■ Each time an Mandible Legion model from your army makes a melee attack that targets a unit within range of an objective marker, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.\n\n■ Each time an attack targets an Mandible Legion unit from your army, if your unit is within range of an objective marker that you controlled at the start of the phase and if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of your unit or your unit has the Titus keyword, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS**\nYour army can include Hive Praetorians units, but it cannot include any Mandible Legion units drawn from any other Cohort."
      },
      "Swarm-Cluster§Shadow-Pincer Talon": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Shadow-Pincer Talon"
          ]
        },
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagem": {
