        },
        "text": "## MASTERS OF SHADOW\n\nEach time a ranged attack targets an\nMandible Legion unit from your army,\nunless the attacking model is within\n12\", subtract 1 from the Hit roll and the\ntarget has the Benefit of Cover against\nthat attack.\n\n## UNPARALLELED TACTICIAN\n\nOnce per battle round, if an Aethon\nShaan model from your army is on the\nbattlefield, you can use the Into Darkness\nHive-Tactic for 0CP."
      },
