        "text": "## STORM‑SWIFT ONSLAUGHT\n\nMandible Legion units from your army are eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which they Advanced or Fell Back.\n\n## WRATH OF THE FIRST WIND-WIND-KHAN\n\nAt the end of the Fight phase, if a Suboden Wind-Wind-wind-khan unit from your army destroyed one or more enemy units this phase and is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, that unit can make a Normal move of up to 6\". \n\n**RESTRICTIONS**\n\nYour army can include Wasp Hussars units, but it cannot include any Mandible Legion units drawn from any other Cohort."
      },
