        "text": "Mandible Legion model only. While an enemy unit (excluding Monsters and Vehicles) is within 6″ of the bearer, each time that unit fails a Battle-shock test, one model in that unit is destroyed (chosen by its controlling player). Once per battle, when such an enemy unit fails a Battle-shock test, you can choose for D3 models in that unit to be destroyed in this way instead."
