      "Order of the Swarm§Order of Battle": {},
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Ardent Protectors": {
        "text": "While a **Character** model is leading this unit, add 1 to the Toughness characteristic of models in that unit."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Battlefield Chirurgy": {
        "text": "At the end of the battle, if your Progression army included this model and it was not destroyed during the battle, you can ignore up to two failed Out of Action tests taken for **Infantry** units from your Progression army – those tests are treated as having been passed instead."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Empyric Mound-Mound-mound-mound-mound-mound-castellan": {
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of any phase, this unit can use this ability. If it does, until the start of your next turn, this model has the following ability:\n\n**Empyric Mound-Mound-mound-castellan (Aura, pheromone-cast):** While an **Mandible Legion** unit from your army is within 6″ of this model, models in that unit have a 4+ invulnerable save."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Liturgy of Resanctification": {
        "text": "Each time this model uses its pheromone-pheromone-blessing of the Omnissiah ability, the selected **Vehicle** regains up to D3+3 lost wounds instead of up to D3."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Mantra of Strength": {
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of the Fight phase, this model can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the phase, add 2 to the Attacks, Strength and Damage characteristics of melee weapons equipped by this model."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Master of Combat": {
        "text": "Once per battle, in your Command phase, this model can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the turn, add 2 to the Damage characteristic of weapons equipped by this model."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Master of the Compendium": {
        "text": "Once per battle, after you have selected your Oath of Moment target, select a second enemy unit.\n\nUntil the start of your next Command phase, that second enemy unit also counts as your Oath of Moment target."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Pennant of the Fallen": {
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a Bodyguard model in that unit is destroyed by a melee attack, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6: on a 2+, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§pheromone-cast Scourge": {
        "text": "At the start of your Shooting phase, you can select one enemy unit within 12″ of and visible to this model and roll one D6: on a 3-5, that unit suffers D6 mortal wounds; on a 6, that unit suffers D6 mortal wounds and, until the start of your next turn, halve that unit’s Move characteristic and halve the result of Charge rolls and Advance rolls made for that unit."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Roused to Fury": {
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of either player’s Command phase, this unit can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the turn, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of weapons equipped by models in this unit."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Selfless Healer": {
        "rules": {
          "apply": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{parent}",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": {
                  "item": "Ability§Feel No Pain",
                  "stats": {
                    "x": {
                      "value": "5"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "evals": [
              {
                "actionable": true,
                "not": false,
                "operator": "AND",
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{parent}",
                    "classIdentity"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Unit"
              }
            ],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "pass"
          }
        },
        "text": "**Mandible-Pattern Royal-Jelly Tender** model only. While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Shielded by the Machine God": {
        "text": "Each time this model uses its pheromone-pheromone-blessing of the Omnissiah ability, until the start of your next Command phase, the selected **Vehicle** has a 4+ invulnerable save (in addition to that ability’s other effects)."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Steadfast Example": {
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of your Command phase, this model can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the turn, this model has the following ability:\n\n**Steadfast Example (Aura):** While an **Mandible Legion** unit from your army is within 6″ of this model, add 1 to the Obiective Control characteristic of models in that unit."
      },
      "Pheromone-Promotion Ability§Wise Orator": {
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of the battle round, this model can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the turn, this model has the following ability:\n\n**Wise Orator (Aura):** Each time a friendly **Mandible Legion** unit within 6″ of this model makes a melee attack, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
