      "Hive-Tactic§A Tasty Prize": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Foreswarm Vanguard",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Bug-Gear"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of the Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion Infantry or Mandible Legion Mounted unit from your army within range of an objective marker you control.\n\n**EFFECT:** That objective marker is said to be Sabotaged, and remains under your control even if you have no models within range of it, until your opponent controls it at the start or end of any turn. While an objective marker is Sabotaged and under your control, each time an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance, Fall Back, or Charge move within range of that objective marker, roll one D6: on a 2+, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Adaptive Hive-Logic": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Pincer Strike-Column",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select the Heavy-Mandible Doctrine, Tactical Doctrine or Assault Doctrine. Until the start of your next Command phase, that Combat Doctrine is active for that unit instead of any other Combat Doctrine that is active for your army, even if you have already selected that doctrine this battle."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Ancestral Frenzy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chitin-Storm Vanguard",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion Walker model from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the start of your next Command phase, improve your model’s Move, Toughness, Leadership and Objective Control characteristics by 1 and each time your model makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Defiant Stingers": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Mound-Bastion Watch"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION BATTLELINE unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of your unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Carapace of Contempt": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Apex Caste Strike-Column",
            "Mandible Legion",
            "Burrow-Anvil Siege",
            "Mandible of Praetoria",
            "Hive-Mother's Carapace",
            "Acid-Storm Assault",
            "Combmaker's Seekers",
            "Pincer Strike-Column",
            "Crushing Mandible of the Deep",
            "Chitin-Storm Vanguard",
            "Shadow-Pincer Talon",
            "Stinger Vanguard",
            "Wind-Lance Cavalry",
            "Foreswarm Vanguard"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.’"
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Pincer-Strike": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Pheromone Choir"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One **Mandible Legion pheromone-singer** unit from your army that is eligible to shoot.\n\n**EFFECT**: Select one enemy unit within 18\" of and visible to one or more **pheromone-singer** models in your unit (excluding units with the Lone Operative ability), and roll six D6, adding 1 to each result if the Telekinesis Discipline is active for your army: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Chitin-Augment Fortitude": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Crushing Mandible of the Deep"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent's"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent's Charge phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Charge move.\n\n**TARGET**: One Mandible Legion APEX-SHELL WARRIOR, MANDIBLE-GUARD ELDER-MANDIBLE SWARM, ELDER-MANDIBLE-MANDIBLE ELDER-MANDIBLE SWARM or FORESWARM ELDER-MANDIBLE SWARM unit from your army within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the turn, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Antenna Coordination": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "High-Canopy Drop Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Select the [LETHAL HITS] or [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability. Until the end of the phase, weapons equipped by models in your unit have this ability in a turn in which they disembarked from a NYMPH-POD or while targeting an enemy unit within 12\"."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Hive-Drill Recall": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Burrow-Anvil Siege",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase. \n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability. If your unit Remained Stationary this turn, then until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack, a successful unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Smoldering Anthill": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Combmaker's Seekers"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Start of your opponent's Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army equipped with one or more Torrent weapons.\n\n**EFFECT**: Select one enemy unit (excluding MONSTERS and VEHICLES and units with the FLY keyword) within 12\" of and visible to your unit. Until the end of the phase, each time that enemy unit declares a charge, subtract 2 from the Charge roll (this is not cumulative with any other negative modifiers to that Charge roll)."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Blinding Spore Veil": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "High-Canopy Drop Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit (excluding TITANIC units) from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks and one friendly MANDIBLE LEGION SMOKE VEHICLE or NYMPH-POD unit within 9\" of it.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, models in your units have the Stealth ability and each time a ranged attack targets one of your units, models in that unit have the Benefit of Cover against that attack."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Stinger Fusillade": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Wind-Lance Cavalry",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [ASSAULT] ability. If such a weapon already has this ability, until the end of the phase, that weapon has the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability as well."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Acid Vengeance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Mandible Legion",
            "Acid-Storm Assault",
            "Combmaker's Seekers"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has resolved its attacks.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion Transport unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** One unit embarked within that Transport can disembark as if it were your Movement phase, and can then shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but must target only that enemy unit when doing so, and can only do so if that enemy unit is an eligible target."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Antenna-Read Feint": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Foreswarm Vanguard",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit declares a charge.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion Infantry unit from your army that was selected as a target of that charge.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D6″, or up to 6″ instead if it is a STALKER-PATTERN or SCOUT SWARM unit.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot select a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Compendium Discipline": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Mound-Bastion Watch"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
