            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit, re-roll a Hit roll of 1. If that target is auspex scanned, re-roll a Wound roll of 1 as well."
      },
