        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET**: One **Mandible Legion Infantry** or **Mandible Legion Mounted** unit from your army that is within 18\" of one or more friendly **Mandible Legion pheromone-singer** models, and that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll, and if the Pyromancy Discipline is active for your army, weapons that target your unit have the **[HAZARDOUS]** ability."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Sting Until the Last": {
