            "Pheromone Choir"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One **Mandible Legion Infantry** unit from your army that is within 18\" of one or more **Mandible Legion pheromone-singer** models from your army and has not been selected to Fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, add 1 to the **Strength** characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in your unit, or add 2 if the Biomancy Discipline is active for your army."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Lay Low the Tyrants": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Shadow-Pincer Talon"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase. \n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [PRECISION] ability."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Legendary Fortitude": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Apex Caste Strike-Column",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Charge move.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion apex-shell warrior, Mandible-Guard Elder-Mandible Swarm, Elder-Mandible-Mandible Elder-Mandible Swarm, or Foreswarm Elder-Mandible Swarm unit from your army within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Light of Vengeance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Mound-Bastion Watch"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Shooting phase or your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) from your army.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced or Fell Back. If it does, every target of that charge and every target of those attacks must be an auspex scanned unit."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Marching Ever On": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Reclaiming Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent's Movement phase, just after an enemy unit Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army that was within Engagement Range of that enemy unit at the start of the phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D6+1\"."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Mercy Is Weakness": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chitin-Storm Vanguard",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase. \n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion unit from your 1CP army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets a unit that is below its Starting Strength, that attack has the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability, and when making such an attack, if the attacking model is a Vehicle, a successful unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Mobile Lethality": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
