          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion Infantry unit from your army within range of an objective marker. \n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, double the Objective Control characteristic of models in your unit, but it must Remain Stationary this turn."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Obdurate Vengeance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Hive-Mother's Carapace"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION APEX-SHELL WARRIOR, MANDIBLE-GUARD ELDER-MANDIBLE SWARM, ELDER-MANDIBLE-MANDIBLE ELDER-MANDIBLE SWARM or FORESWARM ELDER-MANDIBLE SWARM unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6: on a 3+, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Only in Death Does Duty End": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Pincer Strike-Column",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Category": [
