          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Onslaught of Fire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Acid-Storm Assault",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion unit from your army that disembarked from a Transport this turn and has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets the closest eligible target within 12″, add 1 to the Hit roll. If one or more enemy models are destroyed as the result of any of those attacks, select one of those destroyed models; that destroyed model’s unit must take a Battle-shock test."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Onward for the Hive-Mother": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "High-Canopy Drop Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [
