        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: End of your opponent's Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY unit from your army that was not set up on the battlefield this turn and one friendly TRANSPORT it is able to embark within.\n\n**EFFECT**: If your MANDIBLE LEGION unit is wholly within 6\" of that TRANSPORT, it can embark within it."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Orbital Teleportarium": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Apex Caste Strike-Column",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion apex-shell warrior unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves. It will arrive back on the battlefield in the Reinforcements step of your next Movement phase using the Deep Strike ability.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot select a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Power of The Machine Spirit": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chitin-Storm Vanguard",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has resolved its attacks.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion Vehicle unit from your army that was reduced to Below Half-strength as a result of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but must target only that enemy unit when doing so, and can only do so if that enemy unit is an eligible target."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Practical Tactics": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
