        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent's Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY or MANDIBLE LEGION MOUNTED unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units and is within 9\" of the enemy unit that just ended that move.\n\n**EFFECT**: Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D6\", or a Normal move of up to 6\" instead if it is under the effects of the Tactical Doctrine."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Prescient Precision": {
        "keywords": {
