          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One Mandible Legion pheromone-singer unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, that attack has the [LETHAL HITS] ability, and the [IGNORES COVER] ability as well if the Divination Discipline is active for your army."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Rapid Embarkation": {
        "keywords": {
