          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion Transport unit from your army that has no models embarked within it, and one Mandible Legion Infantry unit from your army wholly within 6″ of that Transport.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your Infantry unit can embark within that Transport.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot target an Infantry unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, that cannot normally embark within that Transport, or that disembarked from a Transport this turn."
      },
