        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion Mounted or Mandible Legion Fly Vehicle unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll and subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
