        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Movement phase, just after an MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army ends a Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET**: That MANDIBLE LEGION unit.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Sensory Assault": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Pheromone Choir"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
