            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Command phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One **Mandible Legion pheromone-singer** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT**: Select one enemy unit that is within 18\" of and visible to one **pheromone-singer** model in your unit. Until the start of your next turn, that enemy unit is pinned. While a unit is pinned, subtract 2 from that unit’s Move characteristic and subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for it. In addition, if the Telepathy Discipline is active for your army, that enemy unit must take a Battle‑shock test, subtracting 1 from the result."
      },
