          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Command phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT**: Select one enemy unit visible to and within 18\" of your unit. That enemy unit takes a Battle-shock test. When doing so, subtract 1 from that test and, if that test is failed, until the start of your next turn, that enemy unit is suppressed. While a unit is suppressed, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Surgical Strikes": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Foreswarm Vanguard",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion Infantry unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [PRECISION] ability."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Tactical Decapitation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "High-Canopy Drop Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [PRECISION] ability and each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets a CHARACTER unit, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Tactical Foresight": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Mandible of Praetoria"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent's"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than or equal to the Toughness characteristic of that unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Terrifying Proficiency": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Apex Caste Strike-Column",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion apex-shell warrior, Mandible-Guard Elder-Mandible Swarm, Elder-Mandible-Mandible Elder-Mandible Swarm, or Foreswarm Elder-Mandible Swarm unit from your army that made a Charge move this turn and destroyed one or more enemy units this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** In your opponent’s next Command phase, each enemy unit within 6″ of your unit must take a Battle-shock test. If the unit taking that test is Below Half-strength, subtract 1 from that test. Enemy units affected by this Hive-Tactic do not need to take any other Battle-shock tests in the same phase."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Praetorian Adaptivity": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Mandible of Praetoria"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT**: Select the Heavy-Mandible Doctrine, Tactical Doctrine or Assault Doctrine. Until the start of your next Command phase, that Combat Doctrine is active for your unit instead of any other Combat Doctrine that is active for your army, even if you have already selected that Combat Doctrine this battle."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Praetorian Destiny": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Reclaiming Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT**: Select one objective marker you control that your unit is within range of. That objective marker remains under your control until your opponent's Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Unbowed Conviction": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chitin-Storm Vanguard",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion unit from your army that is below its Starting Strength.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit can ignore any or all modifiers to its characteristics and/or to any roll or test made for it (excluding modifiers to saving throws)."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Vengeful Animus": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chitin-Storm Vanguard",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after an Mandible Legion Vehicle model from your army with the Deadly Demise ability is destroyed.\n\n**TARGET:** That Mandible Legion Vehicle model. You can use this Hive-Tactic on that model even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Do not roll one D6 to determine whether mortal wounds are inflicted by your model’s Deadly Demise ability. Instead, mortal wounds are automatically inflicted."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Wind-Swift Evasion": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Wind-Lance Cavalry",
            "Mandible Legion"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance, or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET:** One Mandible Legion Infantry or Mandible Legion Mounted  unit from your army that is within 9″ of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move of up to 6″.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot select a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Withdraw and Regroup": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Stinger Vanguard"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent's"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: End of your opponent's Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One Mandible Legion MOUNTED or Mandible Legion FLY VEHICLE unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT**: Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Wrathful Conquerors": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Hive-Mother's Carapace"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION APEX-SHELL WARRIOR, MANDIBLE-GUARD ELDER-MANDIBLE SWARM, ELDER-MANDIBLE-MANDIBLE ELDER-MANDIBLE SWARM or FORESWARM ELDER-MANDIBLE SWARM unit from your army within range of an objective marker you control.\n\n**EFFECT**: That objective marker remains under your control, even if you have no models within range of it, until your opponent controls it at the start or end of any phase."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Wrathful Inferno": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Combmaker's Seekers"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Movement phase, just after an MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET**: That unit.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot in a tum in which it Fell Back."
      },
