      "Bug-Gear§Explorator Augury Web": {
        "text": "Enemy units that are set up on the battlefield as Reinforcements cannot be set up within 12″ of this bearer, but the bearer must halve its Transport Capacity."
      },
      "Bug-Gear§Grapnel Launcher": {
        "text": "Each time the bearer’s unit makes a Normal, Advance, Fall Back or Charge move, ignore any vertical distance when determining the total distance the bearer can be moved during that move."
